{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"allowNoSelection"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"title":"allowNoSelection","symbolKind":"ivar","roleHeading":"Instance Variable","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"allowNoSelection"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCSelectionModel@allowNoSelection"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If TRUE, the section allows no selection at all. Default: FALSE."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionModel"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionmodel\/allownoselection-c.ivar"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"allowNoSelection","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionModel\/allowNoSelection-c.ivar","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSelectionModel/allowNoSelection-c.ivar":{"abstract":[{"text":"If TRUE, the section allows no selection at all. Default: FALSE.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionmodel\/allownoselection-c.ivar","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionModel\/allowNoSelection-c.ivar","title":"allowNoSelection","fragments":[{"text":"allowNoSelection","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"title":"STV","url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSelectionModel":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This class functions as a model that is able to provide selection functionality."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The cells in this model represent different items that the end-user can select from, and they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are generated from NSStrings in its items array. Once a cell is selected, a checkmark appears next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to it, similar to Apple’s Settings application where a user selects a Ringtone for their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iPhone. The section can be configured to allow multiple selection and to allow no selection at all."}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionmodel","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionModel","title":"SCSelectionModel","fragments":[{"text":"SCSelectionModel","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}